ulation of this application does not guarantee the design, size, range of motion, etc. of the actual robot.\nWhen actually installing a robot, please check the specifications on the product page.\n- Please be careful of your surroundings when using this app.", "short_description": "You can place OVR series virtual robots in real space and simulate operation.\nThe OVR series is a robot sold by Oriental Motor."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1594860848028062", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210390_1594860854694728_1273340538204967659_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=taqJ9BQUuxMQ7kNvwHaywBb&_nc_oc=AdpCU-PADiw-DzbVEMuJfJyrpqqMReJf-Dj3tQsjLWJki3xAAIiW9gN6idgYlGccO_c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTNMtwaNG-Xd2dwg9HuzpsiKqCe2e2dWCaYzvXF09HU-w&oe=6B0DC316"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscapeMini.png", "id": "858590429630683", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_858590432964016_3799015126354441121_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HqJUeJDldiMQ7kNvwEeMrqn&_nc_oc=Adq5aXAEk7CNfxu61Vrkg36TWiIFQG5UKm7oafr4h_2OBsLAa4oz6nC2gzrDWw2dbrI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTElT11Q2hC9OZGP7FU2GchVJeLvKF8qS6ibvHzvsKiag&oe=6B0DC69C"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "495376463065176", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_495376466398509_7417159219708782199_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-8NXYo3DnZEQ7kNvwGtfIiu&_nc_oc=AdpmH10lNJgNis9iw9oD-sX_YI_Cj-UQvW1WZtZBT_gtS8CSlennokoS_dQTcDpWTqc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSKmeFZJNPhO6G5EedFuiZsdpI6wTkQU18BULsU3kXqfg&oe=6B0DA7DB"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtPortrait.png", "id": "486